{"id":"halah","name":"Halah","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:halah"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Halah","text":"A district of Media to which captive Israelites were transported by the Assyrian kings (2 Kings 17:6; 18:11; 1 Chr. 5:26). It lay along the banks of the upper Khabur, from its source to its junction with the Jerujer. Probably the district called by Ptolemy Chalcitis."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2477","lemma":"חֲלַח","xlit":"Chălach","gloss":"Chalach, a region of Assyria","kjv":"Halah","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H2249","lemma":"חָבוֹר","xlit":"Châbôwr","gloss":"Chabor, a river of Assyria","kjv":"Habor","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H1470","lemma":"גּוֹזָן","xlit":"Gôwzân","gloss":"Gozan, a province of Assyria","kjv":"Gozan","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H5104","lemma":"נָהָר","xlit":"nâhâr","gloss":"a stream","kjv":"flood, river","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H804","lemma":"אַשּׁוּר","xlit":"ʼAshshûwr","gloss":"Ashshur, the second son of Shem","kjv":"Asshur, Assur, Assyria, Assyrians. See H838","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H1540","lemma":"גָּלָה","xlit":"gâlâh","gloss":"to denude","kjv":"advertise, appear, bewray, bring","count":3,"share":1}],"verses":["2Kgs.17.6","2Kgs.18.11","1Chr.5.26"],"related":[{"id":"habor","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":1,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"gozan","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.75,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"gozan","type":"lexical","strong":"H2477","why":"both lead with חֲלַח (H2477)"},{"id":"habor","type":"lexical","strong":"H2477","why":"both lead with חֲלַח (H2477)"}],"works":[]}
